window.products.push({"id":1047020,"name":"MARTHA STEWART Flocked Natural Pine Pre-Lit Artificial Christmas Tree, 7.5 Feet, Multicolored Lights","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":327.21,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813LE81sbrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed by Martha Stewart exclusively for Amazon, this pre-lit natural looking Flocked Natural Pine Christmas tree including stand measures 7 feet 6 inches tall by 4 feet 7 inches wide, and includes a 26 inch wide stable metal base. Constructed with a look and feel that’s strikingly true-to-nature, this tree comes out of the box needing very little shaping thanks to our Memory Wire Branches. With a 2367 tip-count, the flocked, snowy branches are a blend of both PE and PVC for a full and fluffy fresh-cut-tree look. Our hinged branches are permanently affixed as opposed to dated and tedious individually attached branches found on most artificial trees. Vertical internal branches and a garland-wrapped pole make for minimal gaps and spaces, and the secure, self-centering one-screw-stand keep set up easy as 1-2-3. Skip right to the fun of hanging your ornaments! The tree comes prestrung with 600 multicolored incandescent lights to create a colorful and festive glow that remains lit even if a bulb is removed or broken. No more hunting for one light that shuts the whole tree down! Tree turns off and on easily with discreet inline foot pedal, and our patented “power in the pole” Instant Power Technology means that only one plug is needed to send power from the wall all the way through the tree and up to the convenient Tree Topper Plug at the top - no messy extension cords!With durable and white gloves for sprucing up your tree and available in a range of sizes from 5, 7.5 to 9 feet tall, this tree is a must-have for the holiday season!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/813LE81sbrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MARTHA STEWART","source_asin":"B0823G14RF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1047020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0823G14RF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0823G14RF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1047021,"name":"Columbia Comfort Ice Fiber Side Sleeper Down Alternative Bed Pillow - Instant Cooling 2 Sided Ice Fiber Cover - Supportive and Cozy Polyester Fiber Fi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":64.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aIjpyTl3L._AC_SL1106_.jpg","description":"DOWN ALTERNATIVE FILL PILLOW KICKED UP A NOTCH WITH ICE FIBER Instantly feel cool for a better night's sleep with the dual-sided Columbia Ice Fiber covered Down Alternative pillow by Columbia. Revolutionary Ice Fiber technology delivers a cooling sensation while you sleep. This quilted cover is so comfortable, you can sleep directly on it without a pillowcase, especially if you want to feel extra cool. The pillow is machine washable and easy to keep clean. COOLING ON ALL SIDES, ALL NIGHT Don't settle for bed pillows with only 1 cooling side. The Ice Fiber 360 performance pillow is cool and comfortable no matter which side of the pillow you rest your head on. QUALITY 100% POLYESTER FIBER DOWN ALTERNATIVE FILL Standard/Queen fill weight is 39oz. King fill weight is 50oz. Fill is 100% Polyester Down Alt. Filled and Finished in the USA. Designed to be both supportive and cradling for your neck, shoulders and back. SIZING Standard/Queen: 19.5'' x 27.5'' +1.5\" Standard/Queen: 19.5'' x 27.5'' +1.5\" King: 19.5\" x 35.5\" x 1.5\"SATISFACTION GUARANTEEDIf for any reason you’re not 100% satisfied, simply contact our friendly customer support experts within 30-days of purchase and we’ll work with you to find a resolution.Try the Columbia Super Cool Comfort Ice Fiber Side Sleeper Down Alternative Pillow on your bed today and feel the instant coolness of Ice Fiber - Only from Columbia. King: 19.5\" x 35.5\" x 1.5\" SATISFACTION GUARANTEED If for any reason you’re not 100% satisfied, simply contact our friendly customer support experts within 30-days of purchase and we’ll work with you to find a resolution. Try the Columbia Super Cool Comfort Ice Fiber Side Sleeper Down Alternative Pillow on your bed today and feel the instant coolness of Ice Fiber - Only from Columbia.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61aIjpyTl3L._AC_SL1106_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Columbia","source_asin":"B09KZQBKT9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1047021","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KZQBKT9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KZQBKT9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
