window.products.push({"id":1047227,"name":"Hydromatic Cartridge Replacement for The PRC 90","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":65.92,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dCr7VTBAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your pool cartridge filter working at its best with this Cartridge Replacement for the HydroMatic PRC 90 (Old Style 2014 & Earlier). Measurements: Outside diameter x length: 7\" x 19½\" Outside diameter x length: 7\" x 19½\" Inside diameter: 2½\" Inside diameter: 2½\"","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81dCr7VTBAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hydromatic","source_asin":"B00RY34RJG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1047227","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00RY34RJG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00RY34RJG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1047228,"name":"Milk Frother, Itrusou 8-in-1 Electric Milk Frother and Steamer, Automatic Hot and Cold Foam Maker for Coffee, Stainless Steel Milk Warmer Dishwasher S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61786XfbHOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Elevate Your Morning Routine: Making your own barista-style coffee at home with Itrusou milk frother is definitely a better way to save time and money in the daily coffee shop long run. The electric milk frother whisks up the rich, creamy, and long-lasting foam in a few minutes. The consistency of the foam is much smoother than that of a manual or handheld frother. 8-in-1 Milk Frother and Steamer: The electric milk frother has four settings with a single whisk/rotate button, hot fluffy foam for lattes, hot dense foam for cappuccinos, cold foam for iced beverages, or just heating milk, chocolate, cocoa, matcha lattes, etc. All of the settings excel in frothing creamy dairy milk and non-dairy milk. Possibility abound! Thoughtful Design: The food-grade stainless steel milk jug is ideally designed, ensuring that it won't ever rust or transmit a metallic flavor into your drink. The detachable base, ergonomic handle and spout make it easy to pour and create designs of hearts or leaves in your froth. It’s also a measuring cup to use for adding mix-ins. Good for Multiple Drinks: The milk frother has a maximum capacity of 13.52oz/400ml for heating milk and 5.41oz/160ml for milk foaming which means you can froth the milk for multiple drinks at once. Extra Safe: ETL / FDA/ FCC listed foam machine is equipped with micro switch, strix temperature detection, and NTC thermistor. It will automatically shut off when 1. your milk or froth is ready 2. the jug is off the base 3. it is overheated. Buy with Confidence! Backed by a full 2 year warranty, 90 days money back guarantee, 24 x 7 E-mail Support.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61786XfbHOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"itrusou","source_asin":"B0B3WTPH8F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1047228","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3WTPH8F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3WTPH8F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1047229,"name":"GloDea X45 End Table, Wild Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ATsh4au0L._AC_SL1173_.jpg","description":"The end table x45 is refined yet rustic, presenting the perfect balance of functionality, durability and beauty. The table has a pleasing symmetrical design which keeps it nicely grounded. Sturdy and sophisticated, the table will fit as comfortably in a condo as it would in a cozy mountain cabin. The x45 looks great both indoors and out and it can easily be moved from the living room to a deck or balcony as the need arises. The x45 is made to last in the USA from stainless steel and southern longleaf pine harvested from the coastal plains of Alabama. The table is available in ten beautiful colors. The high quality stain finish protects the wood from rain, humidity and the sun. (The x45 is also available with a natural oil finish or unfinished.) These designer tables are shipped in packaging made from recycled materials for minimal impact on the environment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ATsh4au0L._AC_SL1173_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GloDea","source_asin":"B00WFWJIFE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1047229","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00WFWJIFE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00WFWJIFE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
