window.products.push({"id":1047335,"name":"Chrislley 65L Slim Laundry Hamper with Lid Narrow Rolling Laundry Basket with Wheels Upgrade Foldable Dirty Clothes Hamper Portable Skinny Hamper Stor","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ItQTp5QtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✤ UPGRADED BIGGER SIZE -- The size of the enlarged laundry hamper is 41x22x70cm-16.15’’x8.66’’x27.56’’. It is an upgraded version of the 22\" rolling slim laundry Hamper, which can hold more clothes and is very suitable for family use. (The small one on picture is size reference, the price is only for one piece. ✤ DUST LID -- The laundry basket comes with a dust lid which can keep the smells and dust out ,protect privacy. The Velcro tape design makes you easily close and open the lid ✤ FLEXIBLE WHEELS -- The four angles of the steel frame stable fixed with the rolling laundry hamper.There's an additional brake on one of the wheels, which prevent the laundry cart rolling arbitrarily without user's notice.The wheel structure of clothes hamper allows you to transport dirty. ✤ SQUARE STRUCTURE AND SPACE SAVING -- The square structure of the tall laundry basket is easier to put into the corner space. The wheel structure of clothes hamper allows you to transport dirty clothes freely. The four steel pipes can be taken out and then folded, put it in any small space. ✤ MULTI PURPOSE -- This laundry hamper basket with wheels can be used in multiple places, such as bedrooms, RVs, dorms, bathroom, livingroom, apt; Besides for storing dirty clothes, the basket can also be used to store kid's toys and other items.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61ItQTp5QtL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chrislley","source_asin":"B07QYRG46X","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1047335","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07QYRG46X","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07QYRG46X","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1047336,"name":"Pendleton Unisex Jacquard Blanket Robe Oxford/Big Medicine, Twin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":299.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q8N5uKCjL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","description":"The rare white bison occurs only once in every 10 million births. In 1933, a white buffalo was born in the wild on Montana’s Flathead Indian Reservation and was called “Big Medicine” to reflect his sacred power. Many Native American tribes consider the return of the White Buffalo the fulfillment of an ancient prophecy and the beginning of a new era for the peoples and Mother Earth. Tradition spoke of the coming of a herd of pure White Buffalo. The seven bison on this blanket represent the seven directions: North, South, East, West, Above, Below and Within. Together they symbolize wholeness for mankind and the earth. Prayer pipes signify mankind's communication with the Creator. In the center of the blanket, within the circle of life, are four hands representing the diverse peoples of the world and a new beginning. Shades of brown and green reflect the natural beauty of Mother Earth.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81q8N5uKCjL._AC_UL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pendleton","source_asin":"B07BFHC8GF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1047336","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07BFHC8GF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07BFHC8GF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
