window.products.push({"id":1047570,"name":"ASPMIZ Farmhouse Kitchen Mat Set of 2 Anti Fatigue, Cushioned Kitchen Rugs and Mats Non Skid Washable Absorbent, Rustic Kitchen Rug Comfort Mat Set fo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MUUd9fyNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌾ANTI-FATIGUE & COMFORTABLE: The kitchen mat 2 PCS have 0.4 inch thick sponge. Extra thick vintage mat provides comfortable support to help improve circulation and posture and provide cushion on your feet, knees, back, and joints to relieve pain while working in the kitchen or at any work station. Perfect for people who stand for long periods of time. 🌾PREMIUM MATERIAL & ANTI-SLIP: The washable kitchen mats and rugs non-skid have absorbent dutch velvet surface and felt and drop plastic backing. ​The surface has absorbent fabric, which enhances the absorbent function, and the non-slip backing is helpful to keep the farmhouse kitchen rugs sturdy and prevent shifting or slipping, thus enhancing safety. The rustic kitchen mats and rugs are made of superior material to ensure that the mat will keep their shape, even with extended and heavy use. to ensure that the mats will keep their shape, even with extended and heavy use. 🌾EASY TO CLEAN: Our cushioned anti fatigue kitchen mat artistic are easily cleaned. Simply clear dust on the mat with a vacuum cleaner, rinse stains with water or machine wash, and the wooden kitchen mat will remain looking new. The kitchen floor comfort mat will not fade or deform after repeated cleaning. High quality guarantees long-time durability. Make sure the floor is clean and dry before use. 🌾PERFECT SIZES: The farmhouse kitchen mats sets 2 piece are measured the size of 47’’ x 17’’ + 30’’ x 17’’, both sharing a thickness of 0.4 inch (10mm). These two different sizes make it suitable for most kitchen areas, and the 2pcs cushioned kitchen mat may be used separately or in combination to meet different needs. 🌾VERSATILITY: Our comfort standing mat with runner works well on multiple surfaces (wood, ceramic, laminate, marble, concrete, etc), also making people feel good with cute design. The 2 pack brown kitchen floor rugs and mats provide extra large surface area for standing in laundry room, kitchen, office, farmhouse, or in front of sink or any other high-traffic indoor or outdoor space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MUUd9fyNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ASPMIZ","source_asin":"B0BR6GBZYH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1047570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BR6GBZYH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BR6GBZYH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
