window.products.push({"id":1047770,"name":"Bamboo Plastic Wrap Dispenser with Slide Cutter, Aluminum foil Parchment Wax Paper Cling Wrap Roll Organizer Tin Foil Dispenser With Cutter for Kitche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pbsRDTO0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌿【kitchen Storage Dispenser】: Bamboo Plastic Wrap Dispenser organizer with Slide Cutter have 2-Slots,Can store plastic wrap, aluminum foil or parchment paper at the same time, Suitable for Wax Paper,Saran Wrap,Cling Film,wrap dock,Tin Foil Storage dispenser with Slide Cutter.Sturdy and Reusable,making your kitchen more tidy and convenient. 🌿【Built in Slide Cutter】: Our Plastic cling wrap Foil dispenser has the bidirectional and hidden cutting knife provides perfect dispensing and slide cutting, smoothly cutting the wraps, safe design that can’t hurt your fingers when you use and effectively prevent children from touching. The side magnet of Bamboo wood Plastic Wrap Dispense strongly absorbs the cover, which is convenient to replace the plastic wrap, tin foil and oil paper roll. 🌿【Perfect And Practical Storage Dispenser】: Open the side cover lid and place the Plastic wrap foil Parchment Paper Cling Wrap in the storage box. Bigger opening in the middle makes it easier to find the roll start, With sliding cutter for every slot, it ensures a clean cut Everytime and hold each roll in place to keep it from losing the roll start during dispensing. Convenient and quick to operate with one hand, Make your drawer neat and organized with this bamboo wrap dispenser. 🌿【Dispenser Size Tips】: Bamboo wood Aluminum Foil Plastic Wrap Dispenser With Slied Cutter is a 2 in 1, Outer measures: 13.4\"*5.7\"*3.1\", inner measures: 12.3\" *2.5\" *2.7”,Specially designed 1.3“ card slot for easy access to plastic wrap. Compatible with the most plastic wrap of the market as the regular 300FT/ 200FT /150FT /100FT plastic film. In order to facilitate a better user experience, It is not recommended to place rolls of plastic wrap larger than 12 in. 🌿【Keep kitchen organized】: Foil dispenser with cutter is a good helper at home, This Plastic wrap foil dispenser for drawer can be stable on any counter.Ideal for home, kitchen organizer drawer, restaurants, bathroom and office drawer storage. It is good as a gift for mother, girlfriend and friend.As the product is made of bamboo, please keep it as dry as possible. To avoid damage and stains.If you have any questions, please contact us in time, we will solve it for you immediately！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81pbsRDTO0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kerry Nice","source_asin":"B09QPXMYVB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1047770","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QPXMYVB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QPXMYVB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
