window.products.push({"id":1047994,"name":"iHomy 3 Inch Memory Foam Mattress Topper Cooling Gel Infused King Mattress Toppers with Removable Breathable Cover (King, 3 Inch)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bjX-oQAnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🛌SOFTNESS & SUPPORT: Memory foam mattress topper is an effective solution to help you fall asleep easily and stay asleep throughout the night. The topper conforms to body perfectly, adding enough cushion to greatly relieve back pains, you will feel completely rested when you wake up. 🛌COOL & BREATHABLE：Gel infused material is designed with perforations which helps with the air flow and regulating temperature. iHomy memory foam mattress topper will create a cooler and more comfortable sleeping environment for you. 🛌HEALTHIER SLEEP ENVIRONMENT：iHomy memory foam mattress topper is certified by CertiPUR-US and OEKO-TEX, which means it is made with no harmful chemicals and meets all safety standards. No formaldehyde, no mercury, lead or heavy metals. It will be a good companion for your sleep. 🛌REMOVABLE NON-SLIP COVER：The skin-friendly cover with zipper is easy to remove and clean, which extends the using time of the mattress topper. There are 4 elastic straps at the corners, which can fix the mattress topper in place and eliminate the trouble of constantly re-adjusting. 🛌BUY WITH CONFIDENCE: Before first use, please leave the mattress topper flatly in a well ventilated area for 48-72 hours until it’s fully expanded. It is normal for the new foam to have a slight smell, and it will dissipate within 72 hours. If you have any questions, please contact us in time.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81bjX-oQAnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"iHomy","source_asin":"B09TDTHL23","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1047994","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TDTHL23","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TDTHL23","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
